  task-board q 'project_config()'
  task-board q --format compact 'project_config(); models(agent=codex)'
  task-board q 'get(TASK-1) { status }; list(type=task) { id status }'
  task-board q --format compact 'list(type=task) { overview }'
  task-board q --format compact 'plan(EPIC-1, active=true)'
  task-board q 'plan(scope=[EPIC-1, STORY-2, TASK-3], mode=children)'

Usage:
  task-board q <query> [flags]

Aliases:
  q, query

Flags:
      --format string   Output format: "json" or "compact" (default "json")
  -h, --help            help for q

Global Flags:
      --board-dir string      Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default ".task-board")
      --insecure              Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)
      --json                  Output in JSON format
      --no-update-check       Disable automatic update check
      --remote string         Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)
      --remote-board string   Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)

